            "review_title": "Review at Saigon 3",
            "review_text": "Tanya C\n4 contributions\n0\nBe aware! Check your bill!\nAug 2026 • Family\nBe aware! They serve a pigeon iso a duck for less than 6 Euro and they tried to scam us by putting more ‘wet towels’ than used on the bill, then added sugar for 6k and wanted to charge 2% extra to pay with card . Vietnamese card-payment rules have historically stated that a card-accepting merchant may not charge the cardholder a fee simply for accepting the card; the merchant’s processing cost is supposed to be borne by the merchant. \nStaff was rude. Food nice enough. Atmosphere ok. Location walking distance from The War Museum .\nRead more\nWritten August 11, 2026",
