            "review_text": "martensendavid\nMuscle Shoals, Alabama56 contributions\n0\nBusy for reason\nOct 2023 • Family\nWe last visited restaurant back in 2016. (Thanks Covid)\nIt was great then and still is, as far as we are concerned.\nPrimarily we had Dim Sum all of which was great. And yes, compared to other Dim Sum places, it doesn't have a vast selection. If you check both the Dim Sum menu and the regular menu you will find other options. \nWe also had roast pork which includes small bread rolls.\nWe, had a fried rice which is green in color, due to using the water juices from a morning glory type green and also has small bits of seafood mixed in. Very flavorful, as was the greens cooked with garlic.\nOur server Nguyen who seems to kind of run the show, was very attentive and sweet, doting on my mother in law and conversing with everyone.\nA great time was had by all.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten October 6, 2023",
