            "review_text": "karen2558\nMelbourne, Australia271 contributions\n0\nReasonable meal\nJul 2018 • Family\nThis restaurant was recommended to us by our tour guide on our first night in HCM city so we had high hopes of a great meal. Unfortunately our expectations weren't met; maybe we were tired! The restaurant is very plainly furnished and offered both yum Cha and a la carte choices. As there was only two of us, my daughter selected some BBQ pork with rice whilst I had sweet and sour pork. Both meals were tasty and we also appreciated the complimentary watermelon served at the end of the meal. Service was prompt but not especially friendly. There were many tables occupied by large groups so perhaps this restaurant is more suited to groups rather than couples.\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten July 13, 2018",
