            "review_text": "Rhianna M\nFort Collins, Colorado18 contributions\n0\nFast and tasty--huge menu\nJan 2018 • Friends\nWent with my friends. They each got a juice, papaya and strawberry. I had the pudding milk tea. It wasn't the best. Too much ice and not enough tea but it wasn't expensive either. \n\nI just had some chicken and crab rice for 80 dong. Everything came out within five minutes and the wait staff was huge so there were lots of people around to serve. \n\nI'd go back. For Americans I don't think they care to serve us. We didn't get the complimentary water and tea other tables got right when sitting down. Seems more suited for locals but I enjoyed it.\nRead more\nWritten January 20, 2018",
