            "review_text": "Kim T\nMunich, Germany7 contributions\n0\nNever again!\nApr 2016 • Couples\nThis restaurant has \"vegetarian menu\" in big letters and on my map app it also just sais vegetarian restaurant. In NO WAY is this restaurant vegetarian friendly! It starts off with having dozens of fish tanks in the entrance so you can pick your meal. It has about 5 vegetarian dishes. We ordered tofu which was absolutely horrid and didn't cone with anything! Just plain fried tofu. And fried noodles with mushrooms... which lame with pork. No where on the menu did it say pork. They immediately corrected the order and brought us noodles with (again) fried tofu (which we didn't order) and no mushrooms. And these were so bad that we left them as well as the tofu. \nApart from all that it's expensive. Don't go.\nRead more\nWritten April 19, 2016",
